00:29:46.875 --> 00:29:48.001
Okay.

500
00:29:57.761 --> 00:29:58.887
Catch them on the other side.

501
00:30:02.891 --> 00:30:04.476
We're fucked. We're fucked.

502
00:30:06.144 --> 00:30:08.063
- Lucky. stop.
- Stop.

503
00:30:15.279 --> 00:30:16.738
Holy shit!

504
00:30:17.573 --> 00:30:18.866
This is crazy.

505
00:30:46.935 --> 00:30:48.312
- Cary?
- I know.

506
00:30:49.980 --> 00:30:50.981
I don't regret us.

507
00:30:51.064 --> 00:30:52.316
Neither do I.

508
00:30:58.322 --> 00:30:59.323
What are you doing?

509
00:30:59.406 --> 00:31:00.908
Buying us some time.

510
00:31:01.575 --> 00:31:02.910
Shit.

511
00:31:06.371 --> 00:31:07.789
Fuck!

512
00:31:27.100 --> 00:31:28.393
Cary?

513
00:32:22.781 --> 00:32:24.074
It's over. Lucky.

514
00:32:29.079 --> 00:32:30.497
Where's he going?

515
00:32:35.419 --> 00:32:36.837
Couldn't keep him out of it.

516
00:32:38.046 --> 00:32:39.214
What? Wh…

517
00:32:40.507 --> 00:32:42.259
- I'm sorry.
- No. wait. What are you talking about?

518
00:32:42.342 --> 00:32:44.636
He was in deeper than I realized
and it was out of my hands.

519
00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:46.889
No. no. no. You promised me.

520
00:32:46.972 --> 00:32:48.056
I did what I could.

521
00:32:48.724 --> 00:32:49.808
- Sorry?
- I'm sorry.

522
00:32:49.892 --> 00:32:51.852
No. You can't just do that.

523
00:32:51.935 --> 00:32:53.478
It was out of your hands?

524
00:32:53.562 --> 00:32:55.230
You used me!

525
00:32:55.314 --> 00:32:57.107
- I'm sorry. Let's go.
- No.

526
00:32:57.191 --> 00:33:00.194
Okay. wait. No. no. no. You can't do that.

527
00:33:00.277 --> 00:33:01.945
Okay? We had a deal.

528
00:33:02.029 --> 00:33:04.615
You promised me! I helped you!

529
00:33:04.698 --> 00:33:07.784
Do you understand that this is my life?

530
00:33:07.868 --> 00:33:10.078
What is wrong with you? You are a liar!

531
00:33:10.996 --> 00:33:12.664
You lied to me!

532
00:33:27.137 --> 00:33:28.138
They shot me.

533
00:33:30.807 --> 00:33:31.808
Cary!

534
00:33:33.560 --> 00:33:34.811
Cary. Cary. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

535
00:33:34.895 --> 00:33:37.439
I'm sorry. sorry. sorry. Hey. baby.
Don't look down. Don't look down.

536
00:33:37.523 --> 00:33:39.441
Hey. look at me. Look at me.

537
00:33:39.525 --> 00:33:42.194
Hey. Hey. it's okay. It's okay.

538
00:33:42.277 --> 00:33:43.570
Goddamn it.

539
00:33:43.654 --> 00:33:46.114
It's okay. It's gonna be fine.

540
00:33:46.198 --> 00:33:48.283
I think the gun was a bad choice.

541
00:33:48.367 --> 00:33:51.161
Hey. Hey. honey. Don't look at it.

542
00:33:51.245 --> 00:33:52.871
Look at me. Hey. focus.

543
00:33:52.955 --> 00:33:54.706
- Cary. I need you to focus.
- Yeah.

544
00:33:54.790 --> 00:33:58.835
I need you to focus. Look at me.
Look at me. Breathe. baby. Breathe.

545
00:33:59.461 --> 00:34:01.964
Yeah. there we go. There we go. honey.

546
00:34:02.047 --> 00:34:05.467
It's gonna be fine. It's gonna be fine.
It's gonna be fine.

547
00:34:05.551 --> 00:34:06.718
I think I'm gonna die.

548
00:34:06.802 --> 00:34:10.012
No. honey. No. No. baby.

549
00:34:10.764 --> 00:34:13.224
It's okay. It's okay.

550
00:34:13.976 --> 00:34:15.936
Hey. Hey.

551
00:34:18.313 --> 00:34:21.692
Cary? Cary?

552
00:34:25.612 --> 00:34:28.740
You… You were happy.

553
00:34:29.490 --> 00:34:30.659
You were happy…

554
00:34:35.079 --> 00:34:36.081
Cary?

555
00:34:37.833 --> 00:34:39.376
Cary. open your eyes. Look at me.

556
00:34:40.794 --> 00:34:43.088
Look at me. Cary! You can't leave me!

557
00:34:44.338 --> 00:34:45.340
Cary!

558
00:34:46.800 --> 00:34:49.887
Fucking wake up! You can't leave me.

559
00:34:56.309 --> 00:34:57.644
No!

560
00:34:58.854 --> 00:35:01.023
Fucking wake up!

561
00:35:02.316 --> 00:35:03.942
Come on!

562
00:35:07.696 --> 00:35:08.697
Please.

563
00:35:42.064 --> 00:35:43.065
Wait.

564
00:35:55.118 --> 00:35:56.328
Rand. wait!

565
00:36:17.391 --> 00:36:18.392
Where did she go?

566
00:36:23.939 --> 00:36:25.023
Rand!

567
00:36:25.691 --> 00:36:26.692
Officer down!

568
00:36:26.775 --> 00:36:28.610
Rand! Hey.

569
00:37:14.531 --> 00:37:15.574
No!

570
00:37:16.074 --> 00:37:17.284
No!

571
00:37:17.367 --> 00:37:19.369
No! My baby!

572
00:37:19.453 --> 00:37:22.789
- No. you can't. You can't. Come on.
- No! Let me go. Let me go.

573
00:37:22.873 --> 00:37:26.293
No! No!

574
00:37:26.376 --> 00:37:30.214
No! No!

575
00:37:38.889 --> 00:37:40.516
My baby!
